              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyakukhumbula isivumelwano sami esiphakathi kwami nani nazo zonke izilwane eziphilayo zenyama yonke; futhi amanzi ngeke esaba uzamcolo wokubhubhisa yonke inyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.15"
